OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to fight government
OL,4,Adecision on housing plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is to put its case to the
OL,7,Fgovernment on why pulling its current
OL,8,Flocal plan and starting a new one is
OL,9,Fthe best option.
OL,11,FThe proposals are part of West
OL,12,FNorthamptonshire Council's draft local
OL,13,Fplan, which could see up to 47,300 new
OL,14,Fhomes built across the area by 2043.
OL,16,FLess than 24 hours after rejecting the
OL,17,Fplan and deciding to start again, the
OL,18,FReform UK-led authority was told by the
OL,19,FMinister of State for Housing and
OL,20,FPlanning, Matthew Pennycook, it must
OL,21,Fcontinue with the existing plan.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
